Package: baxters-hot-rod-tuner
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Baxters Lab <baxtersbeats@outlook.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
 python3-psutil, python3-fastapi, python3-uvicorn, python3-pydantic, python3-websockets, python3-dataclasses-json
Description: Baxters Hot Rod Tuner — GPU/CPU telemetry and fan control
 Live hardware telemetry with a GTK floater and a local FastAPI service.
 Fan control raises cooling only; it never lowers a fan below the sampled
 baseline (enforced server-side).
